<div data-component-theme="portalThemeColor7" id="ihfkdl" class="row sectionBlockLayout text-left" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0px; min-height: auto; padding: 8px;">
    <div id="issnwo" class="container" style="padding: 0px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div id="i34jlu" class="col-md-4 columnBlockLayout" style="word-break: break-word; flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 300px;">
            <img src="/images/Copy-number-1.png" alt="Number 1" name="Copy-number-1.png" id="ibvcae" style="width: 47%; height: auto; max-width: 100%; box-shadow: 0px 0px 0px rgb(55, 57, 59); margin-left: 0; margin-right: auto;" />
            <h3 id="i3s1tn" style="color: var(--portalThemeColor9); font-family: Verdana;">
                ​<b id="i7cnhl"><span id="isayyi"><span id="id2e0i" aria-label="Text Who We Are Press enter to edit" style="position: relative;">Who We Are</span></span></b>
            </h3>
            <p id="i5rgpe" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 14px;">Founded in 1998, Ksar Capital delivers IT consulting services. Ksar Capital is an independent software and IT consulting firm. We create customized applications and effective system support as well as a comprehensive range of information management and IT services for a broad range of business needs.</p>
            <RadzenLink Icon="accessibility" Path="about" Text="About Us" />
        </div>
        <div id="i5cr7j" class="col-md-4 columnBlockLayout" style="word-break: break-word; flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 300px;">
            <img src="/images/Copy-number-2.png" alt="Number 2" name="Copy-number-2.png" id="iwzy2r" style="width: 47%; height: auto; max-width: 100%;" />
            <h3 id="iqsswf" style="color: var(--portalThemeColor9); font-family: Verdana;">
                ​<b id="ic2j7t"><span id="ifa82m"><span id="i3t6wq" aria-label="Text Projects Press enter to edit" style="position: relative;">Projects</span></span></b>
            </h3>
            <p id="i0wmlu" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 14px;">Specializing in software development, production support, project leadership, business analysis, product customization and integration, our consulting resources draw on years of industry experience across a broad range of vendor platforms supporting front, middle, and back office operations.</p>
            <RadzenLink Icon="accessibility" Path="projects" Text="Projects" />
        </div>
        <RadzenColumn Size="4" OrderLG="3" class="background-color-info-ligher rz-color-on-info- rz-p-5">
            <RadzenImage Path="images/Copy-number-3.png" Style="width: 200px; height: 200px" AlternateText="" />
            <RadzenText Text="What We Do" TextStyle="Radzen.Blazor.TextStyle.DisplayH5" TagName="Radzen.Blazor.TagName.H3"></RadzenText>
            We help our clients achieve their business objectives and maximize their return on IT investments by working in partnership and providing an industry-leading range of consulting and professional services tailored to customer needs and budgets. Being a Microsoft Partner is very important to us as it underpins our real-world expertise and experience of delivering Microsoft technology solutions.
            <RadzenStack AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Class="rz-mx-auto rz-my-12">
                <RadzenImage Path="images/MSlogo.png" Style="width: 608px; height: 300px" AlternateText="" />
            </RadzenStack>
            @* <RadzenImage Path="images/MSlogo.png" Style="width: 150px; height: 100px; float: right" AlternateText="" /> *@
        </RadzenColumn>
    </div>
</div>

